      "receiptText": "1 oz butter\u003Cbr\u003E\n1 onion, chopped\u003Cbr\u003E\n1 lb broccoli or cauliflower\u003Cbr\u003E\n1 pint stock\u003Cbr\u003E\n8 oz \u003Ca href=\u0022blue-stilton-cheese.html\u0022\u003E\u003Cb\u003Eblue Stilton\u003C/b\u003E\u003C/a\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\n\u003Cbr\u003E\nHeat the butter in a large pan and soften the onion for 3 or 4 minutes, add the vegetables and stock and cook until very tender. Crumble in the cheese and stir until melted. Blend to a smooth cream and serve.\u003Cbr\u003E"
